OL,3,GNEWSAFallen WW2 soldier's body
OL,4,Aidentified 81 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoD caseworker Tracey Bowers said L/Cpl
OL,7,FSmirthwaite was a "proud Yorkshireman
OL,8,Fwhose life had been cut short in the
OL,9,Ffinal months" of the conflict.
